title: "[Beslisboom] FluentAssertionPattern.Rewrite → AllSatisfyPattern.RewriteAssertion" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
q1: "x.Should().AllSatisfy(...)?" {shape: diamond}
q2: "Statement (resultaat weggegooid)?" {shape: diamond}
q3: "because (ook met becauseArgs)?" {shape: diamond}
q4: "Inline lambda, 1 gewone parameter, niet async?" {shape: diamond}
q5: "return in de body?" {shape: diamond}
q6: "Direct in een blok?" {shape: diamond}
q7: "Subject veilig twee keer te evalueren?" {shape: diamond}
q1 -> q2: ja
q2 -> q3: ja
q3 -> q4: nee
q4 -> q5: ja
q5 -> q6: nee
q6 -> q7: ja
m1: "Manual: is not in the form\n(and-chain)"
m2: "Manual: is used\n(used)"
m3: "Manual: because message\n(because, because-args)"
m4: "Manual: not an inline lambda / is async\n(method-group, async)"
m5: "Manual: contains a return\n(return)"
m6: "Manual: not directly in a block\n(not-in-block)"
h: "Hoist: var subject = x;\n(subject-call)"
f: "Fixed: x.ShouldNotBeEmpty();\nforeach (var a in x) { body }\n(simple, block, typed-parameter, member-subject, nullable)"
